<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Brickset</title><link>https://brickset.com</link><description>LEGO news from Brickset</description><copyright>Copyright (C) 1997-2026, Brickset ltd.</copyright><generator>Brickset RSS Generator</generator><item><title>This week's top news articles</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135996</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135996</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://brickset.com/assets/images/logo/logo.png' alt="This week's top news articles"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;These are the most read articles that we've posted during the last fortnight:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='neattable'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Article&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Date&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Views&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Likes&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Comments&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135635/review-11388-venetian-neighbourhood'&gt;Review: 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;25 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;12706&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;178&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;88&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135900/21375-godzilla-the-biggest-ever-lego-ideas-set-revealed!'&gt;21375 Godzilla, the biggest ever LEGO Ideas set, revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;03 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;12490&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;103&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;190&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135732/lego-marvel-what-if--sanctum-sanctorum-revealed!'&gt;LEGO Marvel What If...? Sanctum Sanctorum revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;28 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;10898&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;99&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;80&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135941/first-images-of-2027-lego-botanicals-sets!'&gt;First images of 2027 LEGO Botanicals sets!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;06 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;9155&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;129&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;39&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135844/technic-42254-solar-system-planets-in-orbit-official-images!'&gt;Technic 42254 Solar System Planets in Orbit official images!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;01 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;7412&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;122&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;78&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135947/lego-ninjago-71888-ivo-s-ninja-dojo-revealed!'&gt;LEGO NINJAGO 71888 Ivo's Ninja Dojo revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;06 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;7359&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;127&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;74&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135699/11388-venetian-neighbourhood-minifigures'&gt;11388 Venetian Neighbourhood minifigures&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;26 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;7222&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;116&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;43&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135953/2027-chinese-festival-sets-revealed'&gt;2027 Chinese Festival sets revealed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;06 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;6669&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;110&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;34&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135733/three-2027-lego-friends-sets-announced!'&gt;Three 2027 LEGO Friends sets announced!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;28 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;6452&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;78&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;56&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135963/six-more-botanical-sets-for-2027-revealed!'&gt;Six more Botanical sets for 2027 revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;06 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;5937&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;111&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;41&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;The total number of news article views this week is 155,867, which is 23,219 more than last week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 10:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Hydraxon</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135993</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135993</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/8923-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Hydraxon"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/8923-1'&gt;8923&lt;/a&gt; Hydraxon, released during 2007. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Bionicle/year-2007'&gt;31 Bionicle sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/8923-1'&gt;165 pieces&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$19.99 / £14.99, which equates to about US$30 / £24 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 1,815 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=8923-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=8923-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $382.60,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=8923-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135993/random-set-of-the-day-hydraxon"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: twn290</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135992</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135992</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/twn290.png' alt="Random figure of the day: twn290"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/twn290'&gt;twn290&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Mom, Medium Lavender Jacket over Lavender Shirt, Dark Tan Legs, Black Hair&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Town'&gt;Town&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/10257-1'&gt;10257&lt;/a&gt; Carousel, released during 2017.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 41,065 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=twn290&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=twn290'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $5.40.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135992/random-figure-of-the-day-twn290"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 02:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>What's hot this week</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135991</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135991</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://brickset.com/assets/images/logo/logo.png' alt="What's hot this week"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;These are the sets that have been viewed the most this week:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='neattable'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th class='textcenter'&gt;TW&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class='textcenter'&gt;LW&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Set&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Views&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/40865-1/Buddy-the-Elf'&gt;40865&lt;/a&gt; Buddy the Elf&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4673&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/40889-1/Build-Paint-and-Play!'&gt;40889&lt;/a&gt; Build, Paint and Play!&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3047&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;20&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;uarr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/40898-1/Venetian-Water-Taxi'&gt;40898&lt;/a&gt; Venetian Water Taxi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2739&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/42254-1/Solar-System-Planets-in-Orbit'&gt;42254&lt;/a&gt; Solar System Planets in Orbit&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2504&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/21375-1/Godzilla'&gt;21375&lt;/a&gt; Godzilla&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2255&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/75192-1/Millennium-Falcon'&gt;75192&lt;/a&gt; Millennium Falcon&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2109&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/112507-1/Rogue-vs-Zarkt'&gt;112507&lt;/a&gt; Rogue vs. Zarkt&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2099&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/11388-1/Venetian-Neighbourhood'&gt;11388&lt;/a&gt; Venetian Neighbourhood&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2014&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;9&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/42179-1/Planet-Earth-and-Moon-in-Orbit'&gt;42179&lt;/a&gt; Planet Earth and Moon in Orbit&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1861&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/76294-1/X-Men-The-X-Mansion'&gt;76294&lt;/a&gt; X-Men: The X-Mansion&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1743&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;The total number of set detail pages viewed this week is 1,900,339, which is 200,589 more than last week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 23:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Review: 72161 Drone Search for Mythical Mew</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/133777</link><author>SetToBuild</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/133777</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/133777_72161-005_0348.jpg' alt="Review: 72161 Drone Search for Mythical Mew"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Long before Grogu, another cute, rare, powerful, and seemingly ageless creature was sought after for its special properties&amp;mdash;in the hopes of engineering &lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mewtwo"&gt;ultimate beings&lt;/a&gt;. With this set, you too can search for such a mythical marvel, but hopefully for some less nefarious purposes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Back in my day, &lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mew_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"&gt;Mew&lt;/a&gt; was a schoolyard legend, as finding it needed a glitchy miracle, and the process was not a simple internet search away! Now kids can just use a drone&amp;mdash;and a surprisingly fun one at that!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note, this set does not contain a SMART Brick.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/133777/review-72161-drone-search-for-mythical-mew"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Which is the best modular building?</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135979</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135979</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135935_mbc.jpg' alt="Which is the best modular building?"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;The first phase of our quest to determine your favourite modular building is complete.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Over 4,000 votes were cast in our poll which was used to whittle down 21 contenders to just eight. Those eight are as follows, grouped in seeded pairs for the quarter-finals of the knockout phase of the contest:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10255-1"&gt;10255&lt;/a&gt; Assembly Square&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10251-1"&gt;10251&lt;/a&gt; Brick Bank&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10297-1"&gt;10297&lt;/a&gt; Boutique Hotel&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10350-1"&gt;10350&lt;/a&gt; Tudor Corner&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10260-1"&gt;10260&lt;/a&gt; Downtown Diner&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10246-1"&gt;10246&lt;/a&gt; Detective&amp;#39;s Office&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10326-1"&gt;10326&lt;/a&gt; Natural History Museum&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10243-1"&gt;10243&lt;/a&gt; Parisian Restaurant&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The next stage will hopefully commence on Monday with the first two of the four quarter-final contests. But we need your help: we need people to advocate for them, to write a paragraph or two about why people should vote for their set rather than their competitor. If you&amp;#39;d like to do so, just drop a note in the comments stating which one you&amp;#39;d like to advocate for and I&amp;#39;ll be in touch.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&amp;#39;ve listed the unsuccessful buildings and the number of votes they received after the break. I&amp;#39;m a little surprised that the latest one didn&amp;#39;t get much love...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135979/which-is-the-best-modular-building"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Vintage set of the week: Excavator</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135976</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135976</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/604-2.jpg' alt="Vintage set of the week: Excavator"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;This week's vintage set is &lt;a href='/sets/604-2'&gt;604&lt;/a&gt; Excavator, released during 1971. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-LEGOLAND/year-1971'&gt;27 LEGOLAND sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/604-2/rebrickable'&gt;22 pieces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 719 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you might find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=604-2&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=604-2#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=604-2'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135976/vintage-set-of-the-week-excavator"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: sw0979</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135975</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135975</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/sw0979.png' alt="Random figure of the day: sw0979"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/sw0979'&gt;sw0979&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Aldar Beedo - One Piece (4143266)&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Star-Wars'&gt;Star Wars&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/7186-1'&gt;7186&lt;/a&gt; Watto's Junkyard, released during 2001.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 2,787 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=sw0979&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=sw0979'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $151.40.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135975/random-figure-of-the-day-sw0979"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 02:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Six more Botanical sets for 2027 revealed!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135963</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135963</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/11533-1.jpg' alt="Six more Botanical sets for 2027 revealed!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Following the &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135941/first-images-of-2027-lego-botanicals-sets!"&gt;unveiling of four 2027 Botanical sets&lt;/a&gt; earlier today, six more have been revealed at LEGO.com.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;These are a bit different, though: they are small models at pocket-money prices (&amp;pound;4.49, $4.99, &amp;euro;4.99) that are packaged in collectable minifigure sized boxes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View photos of all six blooms after the break.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135963/six-more-botanical-sets-for-2027-revealed!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>2027 Chinese Festival sets revealed</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135953</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135953</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/80123-1.jpg' alt="2027 Chinese Festival sets revealed"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;LEGO has revealed next year&amp;#39;s Spring Festival sets at the annual China International Import Expo that&amp;#39;s currently underway in Shanghai.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/80122-1"&gt;80122&lt;/a&gt; Auspicious Pixiu Under Fortune Tree features the mythical creature who is commonly associated with attracting and protecting wealth, while &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/80123-1"&gt;80123&lt;/a&gt; Spring Festival Voyage includes a family taking to the water in a traditional sailing vessel accompanied by a Year of the Goat minifigure.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;As is always the case with the Chinese festival sets, they are good value for money.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View more pictures after the break&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135953/2027-chinese-festival-sets-revealed"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LEGO Prosperity Lion gift-with-purchase announced!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135948</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135948</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135948_40976_Prod_rC3y2NLYdg6x.jpg' alt="LEGO Prosperity Lion gift-with-purchase announced!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40976-1/Prosperity-Lion"&gt;40976&lt;/a&gt; Prosperity Lion has been announced at the annual China International Import Expo, as a LEGO.com gift-with-purchase to be released on January 1st.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The set contains 411 pieces and is the latest of several sets based on the traditional lion dance that forms part of Lunar New Year celebrations. The purchase threshold to qualify for this gift-with-purchase is not yet known, but we hope to have more information soon.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; LEGO.com seems to suggest this set will actually be available to buy, costing &amp;pound;26.99, $29.99 or &amp;euro;29.99, but the information we were supplied in advance definitely identified it as a gift-with-purchase, so we await confirmation either way.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View more images below...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135948/lego-prosperity-lion-gift-with-purchase-announced!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 05:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LEGO NINJAGO 71888 Ivo's Ninja Dojo revealed!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135947</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135947</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135947_71888_Prod_HjguBvfr9SvD.jpg' alt="LEGO NINJAGO 71888 Ivo's Ninja Dojo revealed!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;NINJAGO includes some wonderful larger models and another has been unveiled today, arriving on January 1st! The press release for Ivo&amp;#39;s Ninja Dojo follows:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/71888-1/Ivo-s-Ninja-Dojo"&gt;71888&lt;/a&gt; Ivo&amp;#39;s Ninja Dojo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Rated 14+, 3,495 pieces&lt;br /&gt;
$279.99 / &amp;pound;249.99 / &amp;euro;279.99&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/click/?s=71888"&gt;Available at LEGO.com&lt;/a&gt; from 1st January&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Rise to the challenge of constructing this stunningly detailed LEGO NINJAGO Ivo&amp;rsquo;s Ninja Dojo collectable building toy from the NINJAGO Legends Embers + Ashes TV series, then explore the expansive interior&amp;rsquo;s many surprises.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Remove levels to find hidden references, elemental lanterns, and more. Take advantage of falling parts and fighting mechanisms to defeat opponents, then ride off in victory on the hoverbike.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Create an epic battle scene with 12 NINJAGO character minifigures. Equip Jin, Mira, Nate, Tre, Master Ivo, Master Zane, Gigi, Duncan, Oni Imperator, Oni Warrior, and Madge and Roland with swords, nunchucks, sai, a claw, and spears for the ultimate fantasy decor.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135947/lego-ninjago-71888-ivo-s-ninja-dojo-revealed!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 03:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: First Order Special Forces TIE Fighter</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135951</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135951</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/75101-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: First Order Special Forces TIE Fighter"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/75101-1'&gt;75101&lt;/a&gt; First Order Special Forces TIE Fighter, released during 2015. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Star-Wars/year-2015'&gt;70 Star Wars sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/75101-1'&gt;517 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-75101-1'&gt;4 minifigs&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$69.99 / £64.99, which equates to about US$95 / £90 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 17,244 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=75101-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=75101-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $86.50,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=75101-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135951/random-set-of-the-day-first-order-special-forces-tie-fighter"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: cty1245</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135950</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135950</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/cty1245.png' alt="Random figure of the day: cty1245"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/cty1245'&gt;cty1245&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Woman - Bright Light Blue Hoodie over Dark Purple Star Shirt, Sand Blue Legs, Reddish Brown Hair, Baby Carrier&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Town'&gt;Town&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/60292-1'&gt;60292&lt;/a&gt; Town Centre, released during 2021.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 2,892 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=cty1245&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=cty1245'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $5.10.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135950/random-figure-of-the-day-cty1245"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 02:01:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>First images of 2027 LEGO Botanicals sets!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135941</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135941</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135941_11519_Prod_IIVIm0yPCWaA.jpg' alt="First images of 2027 LEGO Botanicals sets!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Four new Botanicals sets have been announced, with three arriving on January 1st and another in February.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The highlight among them is perhaps &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/11519-1/Wild-Orchid"&gt;11519&lt;/a&gt; Wild Orchid, which reminds me of the exceptional &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/11505-1/Woodland-Mushrooms"&gt;11505&lt;/a&gt; Woodland Mushrooms launched earlier this year and makes fantastic use of purple seal elements! All four sets look superb though, making full use of the wide variety of foliage elements available.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View the new sets after the break...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135941/first-images-of-2027-lego-botanicals-sets!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 00:00:01 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Poll: Which is your favourite modular building?</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135935</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135935</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135935_mbc.jpg' alt="Poll: Which is your favourite modular building?"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;It&amp;#39;s approaching the time of year when the next modular building will be revealed, so ahead of that we are going to find out which one of the &lt;a href='http://brickset.com/sets/subtheme-Modular-Buildings-Collection'&gt;21 released so far&lt;/a&gt; you think is the best.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is how it will work. First, we will conduct a poll to whittle the 21 down to eight. The eight with the highest number of votes will then compete in a three-round knockout phase, which we like to call &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/news/category-Brickset-Bouts'&gt;Brickset bouts&lt;/a&gt;, to determine the overall winner. We considered starting with 16 and having four rounds, but that would drag on too long.As we have done in previous bouts, we will ask if you&amp;#39;d like to advocate for one of the contenders during the knockout phase, to &amp;#39;big it up&amp;#39; against its rival, so have a think about whether that&amp;#39;s something you&amp;#39;d like to do.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, without further ado, please pick your favourite modular building from the list below:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;form class='form'&gt;&lt;fieldset&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Which is your favourite Modular Building?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class='row' id='option135935'&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10182-1'&gt;10182&lt;/a&gt; Cafe Corner"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10182-1'&gt;10182&lt;/a&gt; Cafe Corner&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10190-1'&gt;10190&lt;/a&gt; Market Street"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10190-1'&gt;10190&lt;/a&gt; Market Street&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10185-1'&gt;10185&lt;/a&gt; Green Grocer"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10185-1'&gt;10185&lt;/a&gt; Green Grocer&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10197-1'&gt;10197&lt;/a&gt; Fire Brigade"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10197-1'&gt;10197&lt;/a&gt; Fire Brigade&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10211-1'&gt;10211&lt;/a&gt; Grand Emporium"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10211-1'&gt;10211&lt;/a&gt; Grand Emporium&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10218-1'&gt;10218&lt;/a&gt; Pet Shop"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10218-1'&gt;10218&lt;/a&gt; Pet Shop&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10224-1'&gt;10224&lt;/a&gt; Town Hall"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10224-1'&gt;10224&lt;/a&gt; Town Hall&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10232-1'&gt;10232&lt;/a&gt; Palace Cinema"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10232-1'&gt;10232&lt;/a&gt; Palace Cinema&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10243-1'&gt;10243&lt;/a&gt; Parisian Restaurant"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10243-1'&gt;10243&lt;/a&gt; Parisian Restaurant&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10246-1'&gt;10246&lt;/a&gt; Detective&amp;#39;s Office"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10246-1'&gt;10246&lt;/a&gt; Detective&amp;#39;s Office&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10251-1'&gt;10251&lt;/a&gt; Brick Bank"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10251-1'&gt;10251&lt;/a&gt; Brick Bank&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10255-1'&gt;10255&lt;/a&gt; Assembly Square"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10255-1'&gt;10255&lt;/a&gt; Assembly Square&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10260-1'&gt;10260&lt;/a&gt; Downtown Diner"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10260-1'&gt;10260&lt;/a&gt; Downtown Diner&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10264-1'&gt;10264&lt;/a&gt; Corner Garage"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10264-1'&gt;10264&lt;/a&gt; Corner Garage&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10270-1'&gt;10270&lt;/a&gt; Bookshop"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10270-1'&gt;10270&lt;/a&gt; Bookshop&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10278-1'&gt;10278&lt;/a&gt; Police Station"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10278-1'&gt;10278&lt;/a&gt; Police Station&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10297-1'&gt;10297&lt;/a&gt; Boutique Hotel"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10297-1'&gt;10297&lt;/a&gt; Boutique Hotel&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10312-1'&gt;10312&lt;/a&gt; Jazz Club"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10312-1'&gt;10312&lt;/a&gt; Jazz Club&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10326-1'&gt;10326&lt;/a&gt; Natural History Museum"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10326-1'&gt;10326&lt;/a&gt; Natural History Museum&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10350-1'&gt;10350&lt;/a&gt; Tudor Corner"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10350-1'&gt;10350&lt;/a&gt; Tudor Corner&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/11371-1'&gt;11371&lt;/a&gt; Shopping Street"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/11371-1'&gt;11371&lt;/a&gt; Shopping Street&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;style&gt;.pollresults {display: none}&lt;/style&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class='row'&gt;&lt;input type='submit' class='pollsubmit' id='s135935' value="Submit"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class='row' id='message135935'&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/fieldset&gt;&lt;/form&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135935/poll-which-is-your-favourite-modular-building'&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: FXX</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135928</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135928</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/30195-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: FXX"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/30195-1'&gt;30195&lt;/a&gt; FXX, released during 2012. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Racers/year-2012'&gt;11 Racers sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/30195-1'&gt;53 pieces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 4,741 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=30195-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=30195-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $11.90,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=30195-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135928/random-set-of-the-day-fxx"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: njo0812</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135927</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135927</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/njo0812.png' alt="Random figure of the day: njo0812"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/njo0812'&gt;njo0812&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Lord Ras - Dark Red Robe, Pearl Gold Shoulder Armor&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-NINJAGO'&gt;NINJAGO&lt;/a&gt; figure that was first produced during 2023. It can be found in &lt;a href='/sets/containing-minifig-njo0812'&gt;5 sets&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 36,005 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=njo0812&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=njo0812'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $5.60.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135927/random-figure-of-the-day-njo0812"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 02:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>BuWizz 4.0 launches on KickStarter</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135926</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135926</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135926_IRP_6951.jpg' alt="BuWizz 4.0 launches on KickStarter"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ten years after the original BuWizz brick was launched, the team are back with a new, more powerful version on &lt;a href="https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/973645257/buwizz-40-ultra-remote-control-for-lego-brick-models"&gt;KickStarter&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;BuWizz is a rechargeable battery and Bluetooth controller for motorised LEGO models. You connect it to compatible LEGO motors, then use the BuWizz phone app to drive the model and customise the controls. With LEGO seemingly abandoning any attempt to make a usable remote control system, BuWizz provides a viable alternative.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The press release follows after the break.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135926/buwizz-4-0-launches-on-kickstarter"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Volcano Supply Helicopter</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135916</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135916</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/60123-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Volcano Supply Helicopter"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/60123-1'&gt;60123&lt;/a&gt; Volcano Supply Helicopter, released during 2016. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-City/year-2016'&gt;45 City sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/60123-1'&gt;330 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-60123-1'&gt;3 minifigs&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$49.99 / £44.99, which equates to about US$66 / £61 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 3,235 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=60123-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=60123-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $48.10,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=60123-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135916/random-set-of-the-day-volcano-supply-helicopter"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 03:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: cas370</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135915</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135915</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/cas370.png' alt="Random figure of the day: cas370"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/cas370'&gt;cas370&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Fantasy Era - Crown Knight Scale Mail with Chest Strap, Helmet with Broad Brim, Curly Eyebrows and Goatee&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Castle'&gt;Castle&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/7041-1'&gt;7041&lt;/a&gt; Troll Battle Wheel, released during 2008.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 2,531 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=cas370&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=cas370'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $17.80.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135915/random-figure-of-the-day-cas370"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 02:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>21375 Godzilla, the biggest ever LEGO Ideas set, revealed!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135900</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135900</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135900_21375_Box2_v29_zF2sdgJixQzT.jpg' alt="21375 Godzilla, the biggest ever LEGO Ideas set, revealed!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://beta.ideas.lego.com/product-ideas/649e11f4-716e-461d-a9ee-0ca32911c075"&gt;Godzilla&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;em&gt;MattE720&lt;/em&gt; was selected for production on LEGO Ideas &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/122407"&gt;last summer&lt;/a&gt; and there has been huge excitement for the model since. It has finally been announced today, containing over 5000 pieces, which makes this the largest Ideas set ever! The press release follows:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/21375-1/Godzilla"&gt;21375&lt;/a&gt; Godzilla&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Rated 18+, 5,363 pieces&lt;br /&gt;
$449.99 / &amp;pound;349.99 / &amp;euro;399.99&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/click/?s=21375"&gt;Available at LEGO.com&lt;/a&gt; from 27th November&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Celebrate a legend of the Monsterverse and pop culture icon with this collectable LEGO Ideas Godzilla (&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/21375-1/Godzilla"&gt;21375&lt;/a&gt;) building set for adults 18 years and up. It&amp;rsquo;s an ideal gift for men, women and monster merch collectors. Immerse yourself in the rewarding challenge of capturing the Titan&amp;rsquo;s imposing presence and recreating his scaly skin and jagged dorsal fins.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Inspired by a Fan Designer&amp;rsquo;s idea, voted for by fans and produced by the LEGO Group, this poseable Godzilla brick-built figure makes an epic piece of movie decor for any living room or office. Once built with its tail to the left or right, adjust its head, arms, wrists and fingers for fierce battle poses. Replace his tongue with the Heat Ray to fire up a display that is sure to spark nostalgic memories for generations of fans.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135900/21375-godzilla-the-biggest-ever-lego-ideas-set-revealed!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Mark's Magic display frame for 11380 Road Bike</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135898</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135898</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135898_P1015470.jpg' alt="Mark's Magic display frame for 11380 Road Bike"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you&amp;#39;re looking for cases or frames display your models in you are spoilt for choice nowadays, with numerous companies offering a wide range of options.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Relative newcomer &lt;a href="https://elevenmark.com/"&gt;Mark&amp;#39;s Magic&lt;/a&gt; manufacturers acrylic cases and wall-mounted frames for a variety of sets and has sent us a couple for our perusal. Today I will examine its &lt;a href="https://elevenmark.com/products/display-frame-for-lego%C2%AE-icons-11380-road-bike?variant=57764859150719"&gt;Display Frame for 11380 Road Bike, type B, LED USB version&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135898/mark-s-magic-display-frame-for-11380-road-bike"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Golden Staff Guardians</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135893</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135893</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/7306-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Golden Staff Guardians"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/7306-1'&gt;7306&lt;/a&gt; Golden Staff Guardians, released during 2011. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Pharaoh-s-Quest/year-2011'&gt;9 Pharaoh's Quest sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/7306-1'&gt;70 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-7306-1'&gt;3 minifigs&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$9.99 / £8.99, which equates to about US$14 / £13 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 7,190 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=7306-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=7306-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $50.00,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=7306-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135893/random-set-of-the-day-golden-staff-guardians"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: njo0782</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135892</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135892</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/njo0782.png' alt="Random figure of the day: njo0782"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/njo0782'&gt;njo0782&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Cole - Crystalized&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-NINJAGO'&gt;NINJAGO&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/71771-1'&gt;71771&lt;/a&gt; The Crystal King Temple, released during 2022.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 1,629 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=njo0782&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=njo0782'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $20.40.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135892/random-figure-of-the-day-njo0782"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 02:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Review: 75642 Showdown with Captain Smoker</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135711</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135711</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135711_Smoker 1A.jpg' alt="Review: 75642 Showdown with Captain Smoker"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Smoker is a popular character in ONE PIECE and made his live-action debut in the second season earlier this year. Famous for smoking two cigars, I queried whether Smoker could actually appear as a minifigure, but fortunately he has, although without his trademark cigars.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/75642-1/Showdown-with-Captain-Smoker"&gt;75642&lt;/a&gt; Showdown with Captain Smoker includes the titular captain with his Billower Bike, plus a couple of Loguetown buildings, which seem extremely detailed. However, I fear the focus on detail has resulted in compromises in other areas, particularly given the price.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135711/review-75642-showdown-with-captain-smoker"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Repair Truck</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135869</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135869</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/3179-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Repair Truck"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/3179-1'&gt;3179&lt;/a&gt; Repair Truck, released during 2010. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-City/year-2010'&gt;37 City sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/3179-1'&gt;118 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-3179-1'&gt;1 minifig&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$12.99 / £9.99, which equates to about US$19 / £15 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 13,246 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=3179-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=3179-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $32.10,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=3179-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135869/random-set-of-the-day-repair-truck"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: trn114</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135868</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135868</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/trn114.png' alt="Random figure of the day: trn114"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/trn114'&gt;trn114&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Suit with 3 Buttons Blue - Black Legs, Black Hat&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Town'&gt;Town&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/6302-1'&gt;6302&lt;/a&gt; Mini-Figure Set, released during 1982.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 1,293 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=trn114&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=trn114'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $5.90.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135868/random-figure-of-the-day-trn114"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 02:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Recent reviews</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135866</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135866</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;These are the reviews that we've published recently:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='reviewlist'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40874-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135696'&gt;40874 Santa's Holiday Countdown&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;A well-built Santa and chimney diorama, with a somewhat pointless countdown feature.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/42705-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135584'&gt;42705 Cosy Autumn Forest Cabin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;A larger autumnal scene with fun moving functions &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40898-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135718'&gt;40898 Venetian Water Taxi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;A nice addition to the Venetian scene but not an essential one&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/11388-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135635'&gt;11388 Venetian Neighbourhood&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;A sizeable and detailed model but its overall appearance is let down by some questionable architectural choices&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40889-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135605'&gt;40889 Build, Paint and Play!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;I am impressed with this set and its concept, but the teal astronaut could be better&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40862-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135271'&gt;40862 Holiday Ornament Selection 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;Four easy-to-build fun ornaments that would look good amongst the branches of your Christmas tree.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/news/category-Set-review'&gt;View more reviews in the news archive »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 23:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Review: 40874 Santa's Holiday Countdown</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135696</link><author>Benbacardi</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135696</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135696_40874-1_4048.jpg' alt="Review: 40874 Santa's Holiday Countdown"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;The last of this year&amp;#39;s Christmas sets for us to have a look at is &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40874-1"&gt;40874&lt;/a&gt; Santa&amp;#39;s Holiday Countdown, a functional display intended to help you get into the holiday spirit by counting down the days until Christmas Day.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;With Halloween out the way, there&amp;#39;s nothing between us and the big day (at least for us here in the UK where Thanksgiving is not celebrated), and this set is here to remind you of that on a daily basis.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135696/review-40874-santa-s-holiday-countdown"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 16:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>This week's top news articles</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135856</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135856</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://brickset.com/assets/images/logo/logo.png' alt="This week's top news articles"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;These are the most read articles that we've posted during the last fortnight:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='neattable'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Article&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Date&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Views&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Likes&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Comments&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135635/review-11388-venetian-neighbourhood'&gt;Review: 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;25 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;10982&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;174&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;86&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135604/lego-ideas-40889-build-paint-and-play-revealed!'&gt;LEGO Ideas 40889 Build, Paint and Play revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;23 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;9405&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;160&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;105&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135605/review-40889-build-paint-and-play!'&gt;Review: 40889 Build, Paint and Play!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;24 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;8694&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;124&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;75&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135732/lego-marvel-what-if--sanctum-sanctorum-revealed!'&gt;LEGO Marvel What If...? Sanctum Sanctorum revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;28 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;8035&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;93&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;75&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135699/11388-venetian-neighbourhood-minifigures'&gt;11388 Venetian Neighbourhood minifigures&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;26 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;6671&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;114&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;42&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135603/lego-daft-punk-confirmed-for-2027!'&gt;LEGO DAFT PUNK confirmed for 2027!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;22 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;6087&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;106&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;87&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135733/three-2027-lego-friends-sets-announced!'&gt;Three 2027 LEGO Friends sets announced!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;28 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;5761&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;74&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;53&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135272/review-40866-santa-s-holiday-sleigh-adventure'&gt;Review: 40866 Santa's Holiday Sleigh Adventure&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;20 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;5546&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;101&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;50&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135188/review-30762-retro-video-game-batman'&gt;Review: 30762 Retro Video Game Batman&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;22 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;5346&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;94&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;45&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135784/how-11383-mayor-manor-looks-with-10228-haunted-house'&gt;How 11383 Mayor Manor looks with 10228 Haunted House&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;30 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3969&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;80&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;37&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;The total number of news article views this week is 132,648, which is 16,730 more than last week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 10:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>New sets out now!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135838</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135838</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/11390-1.jpg' alt="New sets out now!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today sees the launch of four new sets, including the largest ever in terms of piece count, and the first Dragon Ball set. Here&amp;#39;s &lt;a href="https://www.lego.com/en-gb/categories/new-sets-and-products"&gt;what&amp;#39;s new at LEGO.com&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/click/21065"&gt;Sagrada Familia&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;pound;649.99, $799.99, &amp;euro;749.99)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/click/11388"&gt;Venetian Neighbourhood&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;pound;449.99, $549.99, &amp;euro;499.99)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/click/11390"&gt;Dragon Ball: Shenron and Goku&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;pound;129.99, $179.99, &amp;euro;139.99)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/click/10371"&gt;Cosy Plants&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;pound;17.99, $22.99, &amp;euro;19.99)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The gift with purchase this week is &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40889-1"&gt;40889&lt;/a&gt; Build, Paint and Play!, free when you spend over &amp;pound;115 / $130 / &amp;euro;130, and if you buy &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/11388-1"&gt;11388&lt;/a&gt; Venetian Neighbourhood you&amp;#39;ll also receive &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40898-1"&gt;40898&lt;/a&gt; Venetian Water Taxi.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="/click"&gt;Shop now &amp;raquo;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 05:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Helicopter Transporter</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135852</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135852</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/60049-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Helicopter Transporter"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/60049-1'&gt;60049&lt;/a&gt; Helicopter Transporter, released during 2014. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-City/year-2014'&gt;41 City sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/60049-1'&gt;382 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-60049-1'&gt;4 minifigs&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$44.99 / £34.99, which equates to about US$62 / £49 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 2,020 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=60049-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=60049-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $55.00,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=60049-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135852/random-set-of-the-day-helicopter-transporter"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 03:01:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: sw0540</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135851</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135851</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/sw0540.png' alt="Random figure of the day: sw0540"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/sw0540'&gt;sw0540&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Chancellor Palpatine - Dark Bluish Gray Outfit, White Combed Hair&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Star-Wars'&gt;Star Wars&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/75044-1'&gt;75044&lt;/a&gt; Droid Tri-Fighter, released during 2014.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 5,528 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=sw0540&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=sw0540'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $56.30.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135851/random-figure-of-the-day-sw0540"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 02:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Technic 42254 Solar System Planets in Orbit official images!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135844</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135844</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135844_42254_Prod_PKdY0BUr8vek.jpg' alt="Technic 42254 Solar System Planets in Orbit official images!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;2027 announcements continue today with an interesting Technic model, &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/42254-1/Solar-System-Planets-in-Orbit"&gt;42254&lt;/a&gt; Solar System Planets in Orbit!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/42179-1/Planet-Earth-and-Moon-in-Orbit"&gt;42179&lt;/a&gt; Planet Earth and Moon in Orbit was released a couple of years ago and received criticism for its bulky mechanism at the time, whereas this model seems much neater by comparison.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The set will be available from January 1st, containing 572 pieces, but priced at an alarming &amp;pound;89.99, $99.99 or &amp;euro;99.99.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View more images after the break...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135844/technic-42254-solar-system-planets-in-orbit-official-images!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:01 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>What's hot this week</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135848</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135848</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://brickset.com/assets/images/logo/logo.png' alt="What's hot this week"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;These are the sets that have been viewed the most this week:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='neattable'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th class='textcenter'&gt;TW&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class='textcenter'&gt;LW&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Set&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Views&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;uarr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/40889-1/Build-Paint-and-Play!'&gt;40889&lt;/a&gt; Build, Paint and Play!&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3380&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/67005-1/Marvel-What-If--Doctor-Strange-Supreme'&gt;67005&lt;/a&gt; Marvel What If...? Doctor Strange Supreme&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2394&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/11388-1/Venetian-Neighbourhood'&gt;11388&lt;/a&gt; Venetian Neighbourhood&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2371&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;9&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;uarr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/76294-1/X-Men-The-X-Mansion'&gt;76294&lt;/a&gt; X-Men: The X-Mansion&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1764&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;6&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;uarr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/75192-1/Millennium-Falcon'&gt;75192&lt;/a&gt; Millennium Falcon&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1720&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/66248-1/Bonus-Value-Pack'&gt;66248&lt;/a&gt; Bonus/Value Pack&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1307&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/10228-1/Haunted-House'&gt;10228&lt;/a&gt; Haunted House&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1259&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/31167-1/Haunted-Mansion'&gt;31167&lt;/a&gt; Haunted Mansion&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1250&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;9&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/6086-1/Black-Knight-s-Castle'&gt;6086&lt;/a&gt; Black Knight's Castle&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1217&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/11383-1/Mayor-Manor'&gt;11383&lt;/a&gt; Mayor Manor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1160&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;The total number of set detail pages viewed this week is 1,690,128, which is 82,648 fewer than last week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 23:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>My LEGO 'Fear'</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135830</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135830</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135830_Sticker Panel.jpg' alt="My LEGO 'Fear'"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Happy Hallowe&amp;#39;en!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There are many things to fear in LEGO sets, from expensive prices and poor colour matching to &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/76274-1/Batman-with-the-Batmobile-vs-Harley-Quinn-and-Mr-Freeze"&gt;agonisingly descriptive set names&lt;/a&gt; and the recently-revealed &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/67012-1/The-Joker-Wall-Art-Comic-Cover"&gt;67012&lt;/a&gt; The Joker Wall Art Comic Cover.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, I encountered something else I really dislike while constructing &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/75645-1/Battle-at-Drum-Castle"&gt;75645&lt;/a&gt; Battle at Drum Castle yesterday: the dreaded &amp;#39;sticker applied on the inside of a wall panel&amp;#39;!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;These are occasionally a necessary feature, where space is at an absolute premium, but I find them annoying for a number of reasons. Chief among them is that I think such details can be brick-built in the vast majority of cases and that is certainly the case with the shelves in Drum Castle. Also, they are tricky stickers to apply because it can be easy to trap dust or air bubbles underneath and you only have one chance to place them, as you cannot reach the corners to lift them for another attempt, trapped inside the panel as they are.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Even worse is the horrifying &amp;#39;sticker applied on the inside of a curved wall panel&amp;#39;, but those are fortunately quite rare nowadays. I still remember my apprehension placing a sticker on the inside of an &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/parts/design-48310"&gt;8x4x6 half cone element&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/76387-1/Hogwarts-Fluffy-Encounter"&gt;76387&lt;/a&gt; Hogwarts: Fluffy Encounter!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Do you have any LEGO fears like mine? Let us know in the comments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Vintage set of the week: 21 8-Stud Bricks</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135825</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135825</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/918-2.jpg' alt="Vintage set of the week: 21 8-Stud Bricks"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;This week's vintage set is &lt;a href='/sets/918-2'&gt;918&lt;/a&gt; 21 8-Stud Bricks, released during 1969. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-System/year-1969'&gt;31 System sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/918-2/rebrickable'&gt;21 pieces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 38 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you might find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=918-2&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=918-2#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=918-2'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135825/vintage-set-of-the-week-21-8-stud-bricks"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: colmar04</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135824</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135824</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/colmar04.png' alt="Random figure of the day: colmar04"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/colmar04'&gt;colmar04&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Winter Soldier, Marvel Studios, Series 1&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Collectible-Minifigures'&gt;Collectible Minifigures&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/71031-4'&gt;71031-4&lt;/a&gt; Winter Soldier, released during 2021.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 25,466 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=colmar04&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=colmar04'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $9.00.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135824/random-figure-of-the-day-colmar04"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 02:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Ninth Panel: A new display case company launched this week</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135805</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135805</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135805_Ninth Panel Case Closed Lockup Colour Transparent.jpg' alt="Ninth Panel: A new display case company launched this week"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;The LEGO display-case market has grown considerably in recent years, with collectors now able to choose from a wide range of attractive, set-specific displays. However, the experience surrounding those products has not always kept pace. Lengthy lead times, uncertain dispatch dates and slow customer service remain common frustrations.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Today, we are delighted to announce a new partnership with &lt;a href="https://NinthPanel.com"&gt;Ninth Panel&lt;/a&gt;, a founder-led company aiming to raise the standard in these areas, and a limited-time discount for Brickset on its first products.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The company launched earlier this week in the UK with its first two display cases available now and is preparing to begin domestic US fulfilment from its facility in Lakeland, Florida, on 16 November. Its approach combines thoughtful set-specific products with finished stock, prompt customer care and a closer relationship with the collectors buying them.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135805/ninth-panel-a-new-display-case-company-launched-this-week"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>